# Upload context for `gcloud run deploy --source .` (Cloud Build). Unlike .gitignore, the retrieval
# index in data/processed/index IS uploaded: the Dockerfile bakes it into the image.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
frontend/
data/raw/
models_cache/
eval/results/
paper/
submission/
docs/
**/.env
backend/.env
